            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Congratulations, Senior Liaison. First contact with a new civilization is no small task, but I am... confident in your qualifications.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_LM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LM/Ione_Virga_AR-PreLM_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You have another objective as well: this World Synthesizer. A machine capable of harvesting land on such a scale is too dangerous to leave unattended.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_LM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LM/Ione_Virga_AR-PreLM_010.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And I understand Lemuria no longer needs it. So find this World Synthesizer and bring it back here that we may determine how to destroy it.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_LM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LM/Ione_Virga_AR-PreLM_011.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And one more thing, this ghost that follows you. Whatever it is or isn't, whatever it wants, it causes... discomfort. Be wary of it.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_LM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/LM/Ione_Virga_AR-PreLM_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
